# Multi-byte Evaluation Tests
# Validates that multi-byte identifiers evaluate correctly end-to-end

## CJK variable names
a = 3
手 = a * 5
給料 = 5000
收入 = 給料 * 12

## Latin extended variable names
café = 100
résumé = café + 50

## Cyrillic variable names
Москва = 200
доход = Москва * 3

## Emoji variable names (supported ranges)
💰 = 1000
🎯 = 💰 + 500

## Cross-script variable references
total = 手 + café + Москва + 💰
# Expected: 1315

## Multi-byte with arithmetic operations
和 = 手 + 給料
差 = 收入 - 💰
積 = café * доход

## Multi-byte with functions
平均 = avg(手, café, Москва, 💰)
根 = sqrt(café + résumé + Москва + 50)
